private text delta, including the historical setup failure and all binary evidence.\n\n## Test Plan\n\n- [x] Renewed independent acceptance review, exact source input preflight and nine focused engineering phases.\n- [x] Both complete local positive and intended-negative control lanes passed on source9886.\n- [x] Actual capture2: all five CI jobs passed; raw transport and independent capture provenance inspection approved.\n- [x] Root selected the actual candidate, operator application, passed receipt and acyclic recovery policy.\n- [ ] First actual matching-runtime verification, transport and independent two-pass provenance review.\n- [ ] Restoration acceptance, literal readiness controls, final executable seal, Mode B and fresh QA.\n- [ ] Evidence capture, planning refresh, exact-head CI and merge readiness.\n\nThe bounded repair qualification is not whole-feature approval. Comparative framework performance remains unmeasured.\n","created_at":"2026-10-15T11:10:22Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T14:44:45Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"e3ce1bb21e6111f80b6ede02f47c2fde2efb6ce8","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niq-cnr/nizam-framework/pulls/104/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niq-cnr/nizam-framework/pulls/104/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niq-cnr/nizam-framework/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niq-cnr/nizam-framework/issues/104/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niq-cnr/nizam-framework/statuses/1d62c73cfeb41fbb4c47610ddeda77c054b9dd66","head":{"label":"niq-cnr:phase/018-control-closeout","ref":"phase/018-control-closeout","sha":"1d62c73cfeb41fbb4c47610ddeda77c054b9dd66","user":{"login":"niq-cnr","id":233528675,"node_id":"U_kgDODetdYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233528675?v=4","gravatar_id":"","